-------------------- READING --------------------
TEST 1 (did the suppressor return at a healthy LR?)
  Compare C1 @ 5e-4 open%  vs  C1 @ 3e-3 open%.
  If 5e-4 open% is near 0 AND its val_loss is ~3.3, the high-LR
  extremes were instability, not learned selection.

TEST 2 (is C1's high-LR gate saturated from blow-up?)
  Compare |logit| for C1 @ 3e-3  vs  C3 @ 3e-3.
  If C1's |logit| is much larger, its gate hit the rails because
  the logits exploded, not because it learned a bimodal code.
